  "context_zh": "住户平静地向入口处的来访者说明吸烟造成的影响，并指引到指定区域。",
  "author": "author-phase04-c",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "p04-c-10-s01",
      "speaker": "Mina",
      "text": "Excuse me. I'm unhappy about the smoking right beside our entrance. The smoke comes into the hall."
    },
    {
      "id": "p04-c-10-s02",
      "speaker": "Rob",
      "text": "Sorry, I didn't know. You don't need to shout."
    },
    {
      "id": "p04-c-10-s03",
      "speaker": "Mina",
      "text": "I wasn't trying to. It's hard to hear over that delivery truck. The smoking area is across the courtyard."
    },
    {
      "id": "p04-c-10-s04",
      "speaker": "Rob",
      "text": "Thanks for explaining. I'll put this out and move over there."
    }
  ],
